WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Continue with Google.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Choose harkit@pragra.io.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.966
Open Compare a resume from your dashboard.

00:00:08.966 --> 00:00:11.538
Upload your existing resume.

00:00:11.538 --> 00:00:14.086
Add the job you have in mind.

00:00:14.086 --> 00:00:18.457
Compare the original document with the role.

00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:21.119
Review your scores and the skills the role asks for.

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:23.769
Hover the contact highlight to see its suggested fix.

00:00:23.769 --> 00:00:26.169
Hover the skills highlight to see the missing job requirement.
